    "created_at": "2017-07-03T15:01:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-07-03T15:01:49Z",
    "body": "The cookie header (for example) is set during the `http-network-or-cache` algorithm. The request object that has the cookie header added to it is a copy of the initial request (step 3). If a redirect occurs, the request object that is used as the base of the copy for the next request does not have the header present.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
